<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田夕食.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>We feasted on the Arata settlement's unusual food.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had been saying she was too tired to eat or whatever, but after <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> and I talked her around, she finally came down to the living room.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mmm! This brings me back to life! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Nourishing and invigorating, energy restored! These Arata ingredients are like the world's most delicious medicine! Food is medicine, truly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right!? Here in Arata it's not just the food, the drinks are good too!"</STYLE><PG>
Holding her drink, <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was swaying side to side like a different person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably the bad-drunk type...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd watched <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>, who loves his drink, so I could more or less tell.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ahh, a drink after a good day's work tastes great!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right!? When it comes to drinks, it's gotta be Arata!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> were happily pouring drinks for each other.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was quite a gap between what <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had said earlier and how she was acting toward <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, deep down she wants to prove <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> innocent, so maybe it's natural for her to act like this, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what do you think of those two?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? They seem so close, it's nice! I think a close family is wonderful!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, no, that's not what I meant...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But knowing <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, she's probably observing the two of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To find those <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ささい">trivial</STYLE> contradictions or whatever.<PG>
Do <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="8">Haruka's grandmother</STYLE> even know about my intuition in the first place?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They probably allowed me to attend the thirteenth-year memorial service because they know, but then there's the warning Shirozaki-san gave earlier: 'No one must find out.' [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does it apply to everyone outside the Niimura family, or to the whole settlement, the Niimura family included―<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has a psychic power that only works at this time of year! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Had you heard?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> had suddenly made a move...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even drunk <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE>'s face tightened a little.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s psychic power? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Sure, of course I've heard! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="5">Well... don't take this the wrong way, but try not to mention it in this settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is the reason some folks are scared of it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So he knew...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, what Shirozaki-san meant was 'No one outside the Niimura family must find out.'<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why did </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> awaken to an ability like that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, that! I wanna hear that too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE>'s tightened face went slack again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> was apparently going to approach it from the reason I'd been called here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"The reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> awakened to the ability... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Hmm, when did she notice the ability... I think it was around high school... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">No, was it middle school..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least it wasn't something she was born with.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then there must have been a trigger, like with me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Uh, so did </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> get sick too? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Since I started being able to use this intuition, I apparently got sick in cherry-blossom season..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now, how will he answer...!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> did tend to get sick in spring too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Well, it was just that she'd feel unwell if she stayed in a dark, cramped place, so as long as she watched out for that, it was no big deal."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Come to think of it, I apparently got sick from being out in the wind. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But to make my intuition work, I had to be out in the wind."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was like that too. Once the cherry trees started blooming, everyone would go to </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> for advice on how to hunt that day, which route to pick, that sort of thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> put everything into living up to that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">She used a small three-mat room on the second floor, and she'd often push herself too hard and get sick."</STYLE><PG>
The conditions differed, but it was a lot like my intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hear <STYLE ID="10">Ojisan</STYLE>'s voice, but whose voice did <STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE> hear?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"I remember now! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> awakened to the ability in middle school! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Back then </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was still in Arata, so I'm sure of it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, right... It never felt real, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was born and raised here too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So did </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> hunt too?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> wasn't all that good at it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">One time he pushed too hard and even broke his leg. </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> had a bad leg, you know that, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　That's how </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> lost his confidence that he could live here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So that's how it was. That's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> left Arata..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"It was rough back then. Me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, we tried to talk him out of leaving..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> married <STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE>, his childhood friend, so naturally she'd have been <STYLE ID="10">Ojisan</STYLE>'s childhood friend too...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What kind of relationship did <STYLE ID="10">Ojisan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE> have?<PG>
Maybe <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Ojisan</STYLE> ended up in a love triangle over <STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmm, but maybe that's overthinking it...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... a high-school girl like me asking this kind of question... would probably be forgiven, right?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Haruka's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> were all close since you were little, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How will he answer this...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Of course! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">　Well, I can say it honestly now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> seemed to like </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> better... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">He was always shy and wishy-washy, but it seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> couldn't leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> alone, him being like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh... That's pretty critical... [TN: 'Oh' is written in English in the source.]<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ho-hooh, so with </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> gone, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> made his move, did he!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No, it's not that I made a move, or anything... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">See, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was gone, and the time I spent alone with </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> just got longer..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> was grinning sheepishly.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "130" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Ah, anyway, back to what we were talking about..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe going any further was too embarrassing. <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> was trying to change the subject.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s reason for awakening to her intuition, right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> herself probably didn't realize she had the ability the moment it awakened, so pinning that down is hard..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I glanced over at <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see, I see. A case of stolen love, then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"I-I told you, it's not like that! Me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> were together since we were little, so it wasn't anything like...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Smirking, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> kept gouging at <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE>'s heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She didn't look like she suspected <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> much.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,000" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Just then, the room's sliding door opened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ美冬.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Oooh-hohoho! </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> has come to the Arata settlement for the first time in ages!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"O-ohoho... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu... Niimura..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\天然ボケにご用心.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
A middle-aged woman dressed far too young for her age.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And an old lady in the same outfit, standing on the other side of the sliding door.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"How do I put it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is hard to comment on... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The choice of who to impersonate is just way too iffy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
